+	/*
+	 * Power sequencer for the QCA6490 combo chip. It owns the enable
+	 * lines and the shared rails for both radios, so it has to exist
+	 * before either the Bluetooth UART child below or a future WLAN
+	 * endpoint on PCIe RC0 can be powered.
