+&soc {
+	/*
+	 * Xiaomi ABL consumes the Android restart reason at IMEM + 0x65c.
+	 * The vendor FDT exposes the same 4-byte window below its msm-imem
+	 * container; a direct /soc@0 child survives ABL's later overlay while
+	 * root-level additions do not.
